<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-ARAB SUPER-CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARAB SUPER-CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Arab Super Cup</p>
<p>soccer first round matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>al-Ahli (Egypt) beat al-Faycali (Jordan) 4-0 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Hadi Khabacha 5, Ahmed Felix 20, Mouhannad</p>
<p>Nouhadine 64 o.g, Walid Salhdine 89</p>
<p>Raja Casablanca (Morocco) and Khouribga (Morocco) drew 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>The second leg of the three round match will be played on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
</text>
